{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n お久しぶりです。☁️\n なかなかブログを更新できずですみません。\n 遂に明日からBACKS LIVEが始まります\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n メンバーにどれほど支えられて、助けられていたのか、改めて身に沁みました。\n 自分の中でメンバーの存在が凄く大きかった。\n \n 本当にありがとうという気持ちです\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZ0G58B57EA9RBFS167AJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZ1K0CF516YYNNZ6PB71E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZ2KEYCXCSMYM04VWZJZW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZ3MW5FGECNA7W4DYYN53","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZ4PKNYJF7KG302ZY6586","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZ5QSTP4K3DZ5K2YHSMGW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZ6S54GHX7RFDYP8789BX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZ7YNPGY65M2RMW1MXN6Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZ8ZYAM08HB5RFFVKWTFC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZA14F11095KX6B2ZG5FB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZB13YASV0BE24JNYA9FX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZC1GN43FAA1X5VNEJAQM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KZD17C747QDCTK5HAJF7R","alt":""},{"t